      en: ["Progreso was founded on November 15, 1871.", "The city is located 29 kilometers north of Montevideo.", "The railway played a key role in the city's development.", "The region is an important center for viticulture in Uruguay.", "The population was 16,244 inhabitants according to the 2011 census.", "Progreso is part of the Montevideo metropolitan area.", "It was elevated to city status on December 11, 1981, by Law No. 15.228.", "Besides wine, peaches, apples, and quinces are also grown."],
      es: ["Progreso permite conocer de cerca la cultura y las tradiciones de la zona.", "Destaca por su variedad arquitectónica y su valor histórico.", "Los alrededores ofrecen múltiples posibilidades para realizar actividades al aire libre."],
