      en: ["The population of Tranqueras is approximately 7,000 inhabitants.", "The town was officially given the status of 'ciudad' (city) in 1994.", "Its nickname is the 'Capital of Sandstone' (Capital de la Arenisca).", "The city is located at the junction of national routes 30 and 5.", "An important local festival is the Watermelon and Wine Festival.", "The name 'Tranqueras' means 'gates' in Spanish."],
