      en: ["Originally founded in 1829.", "The population is approximately 12,200 (2011 census).", "Located at the triple frontier of Uruguay, Brazil, and Argentina.", "The main producer of sugarcane in Uruguay.", "Its name means 'Beautiful Union'.", "Separated from Argentina by the Uruguay River."],
