      en: ["The city was founded in 1680 by the Portuguese.", "Its historic quarter was declared a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1995.", "Its population as of 2011 was 26,231 inhabitants.", "It is located on the Río de la Plata, about 177 kilometers west of Montevideo.", "The famous 'Calle de los Suspiros' (Street of Sighs) is a city landmark.", "A ferry service connects the city to Buenos Aires, Argentina in about one hour."],
