      en: ["Rosario was founded on January 24, 1775.", "It is one of the oldest cities in Uruguay.", "As of the 2011 census, the city had a population of 10,085.", "The city was founded by Benito Herosa.", "Its economy is heavily agricultural, particularly soybeans and wheat.", "It is located on the banks of the Rosario River."],
      es: ["Muestra fielmente las costumbres y la cultura de la zona.", "Resalta por su patrimonio arquitectónico y peso histórico.", "En sus cercanías se pueden realizar diversas actividades de ocio activo."],
